  description: 'During each of your opponent''s End Phases: Gain Life Points equal
    to the number of times you took battle damage this turn x 500. When a "Number"
    monster you control is targeted for an attack, except "Number C" monsters: You
    can send this card to the Graveyard; negate the attack, then Special Summon,
    from your Extra Deck, 1 "Number C" monster with the same number in its name as
    that "Number" monster you control, by using it as the Xyz Material. (This Special
    Summon is treated as an Xyz Summon. Xyz Materials attached to it also become
    Xyz Materials on the Summoned monster.) You can only control 1 "Don Thousand''s
    Throne".'
